  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Oper of CC&amp; Env progra-UNDP-SYR-00130229</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is developing a strategy to operationalise the UNDP (CPD) for the period 2022-2024 considering the strategic areas of climate change and natural resource management and proposing a set of activities to be implemented during the following three years. In this regard, consultancy will support UNDP Syria to develop the overall strategy reflecting the basic principles, strategic directions, and the theory of change to be considered in formulating the strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
